        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Which zero turn mower has the best bagger?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Among factory baggers sold on Amazon, Cub Cadet's 49A70001100 for 48-inch Ultima ZTX mowers has the most capacity at 11 bushels. Husqvarna's 9-bushel triple baggers for the Z254 and Z254F are close behind. For heavy wet leaves, dealer-sold powered baggers such as Ariens' IKON unit handle conditions passive baggers cannot."
